  "method": "Seed 20261025; real act/advance; 3 sessions/day at 08/13/20, <=45 commands and <=8 meals/session; two farms, each sowing the best-liked unlocked crop ripe by the next visit; each farm goes to level 3 (fancy crops) from player level 20 once 63 000 pattes are in hand; pattes saved for the next coin goal (salon, next extension allowed by the level, farm level 3) before the counter, except while Hearts are short for a statue; save Hearts two levels ahead for each statue (60 Hearts at level 15, 100 at level 22) plus six in reserve; food kept for the most loved rabbit waiting at a wall (29 -> 30, 49 -> 50); collection-first parent pairs; no paid recipes; daily routine: the harvest and breeding missions claimed when shown and done; while a rabbit needs the 3-day streak, every shown mission once done and the cycle bonus; caresses on three rabbits when that mission is shown; the travel agency at level 8 with 1 500 pattes, a trip for each rabbit that still needs one (no other trip); one Cuisine recipe for a commis or taster that still needs it; the jump-rope islet once a rabbit needs a « corde » challenge and 75 000 pattes plus the coin goal are in hand (25 jumps); every rabbit evolved as soon as it can; Salon de soins bought at level 12 with 5 500 pattes in hand, one care per session for the most loved rabbit that may receive a gift (massage with 3 000 pattes left in hand, else bath), one picnic a day in the enclosure where the most rabbits gain (500 pattes kept); Hearts for permanent farm, agency and habitat upgrades after the statue reserve. Counter reserves: the coin goal (or 3000 coins while Hearts are short for a statue) and 6000 food plus a waiting wall meal. Day snapshots just before next 08:00. Tutorial is the first session.",
